Fixture provenance
==================

dt_platform_hii.bin is an HII package list built from two unmodified outputs of
a Mu-Silicium build (qcomvpPkg, DEBUG_CLANGPDB, AARCH64):

  forms package:   Build/qcomvpPkg/DEBUG_CLANGPDB/AARCH64/EmbeddedPkg/Drivers/
                   DtPlatformDxe/DtPlatformDxe/DEBUG/DtPlatformHii.c
                   (the compiler-generated byte array; its leading array length
                   word is dropped and the FORMS package bytes are kept as-is)
  strings package: Build/qcomvpPkg/DEBUG_CLANGPDB/AARCH64/EmbeddedPkg/Drivers/
                   DtPlatformDxe/DtPlatformDxe/OUTPUT/DtPlatformDxeStrDefs.hpk
                   (a single STRINGS package, copied as-is)

The test composes them into one EFI_HII_PACKAGE_LIST_HEADER whose GUID is
gDtPlatformFormSetGuid (2b7a240d-d5ad-4fd6-be1c-dfa4415f5526), followed by the
FORMS package, the STRINGS package and an EFI_HII_PACKAGE_END package. Only
the list header and end package are synthesized; the two package payloads are
byte-identical to the build output.

The corresponding source is
Mu_Basecore/EmbeddedPkg/Drivers/DtPlatformDxe/DtPlatformHii.vfr, copyright
(c) 2017 Linaro, Ltd., licensed BSD-2-Clause-Patent. The generated files derive
from that source under the same license.
